# fn-159.5/.8: the capability kind and bound renames change no step table. Bound renames for the IR
# comparison after Batch 5b: nexus workflow control -> eight; close policy four/five/twelve ->
# fourWide/fiveWide/twelveWide; the rest keep their names.
